{
    "title": "Bass Booster Volume Booster EQ",
    "description": "Bass Booster & Eq Plus is an easy-to-operate, simple, and free app. And that is specially designed for music enthusiasts. this application can adjust the volume, customize the sound effect presets, and you can also change the skin of the application according to your preferences!\r\n\r\nSo what are the functions of Bass Booster & Eq Plus:\r\n-Compatible with your favorite music players.\r\n-Clean, simple interface and user-friendly, we have simple and beautiful design.\r\n-Manually adjust the volume booster to increase your volume higher than the system default value. You can also manually adjust the bass booster and virtualizer at will.\r\n-You can directly play/pause or click to play the next/previous song from Bass Booster & Eq Plus.\r\n-5-band equalizer. According to different music genres, 9 equalizer presets are available for free.\r\n-Custom equalizer presets, the \"Save\" option can store your custom presets, and you can edit or delete custom presets at any time.\r\n-You can change the skin of the application according to your preferences.\r\n-Support headphone, video player, and vehicular audio.\r\n\r\nA good volume booster can bring you a fantastic music experience! We insist on easy-to-use volume booster application. Choose this application to make your voice louder! \r\n\r\nNeed to be reminded here:\r\nPlaying audio at high volume may damage your hearing or damage the speakers. We recommend that you gradually increase the volume to obtain a suitable volume. \r\n\r\nIf you have any problems with the app, please send your questions/ feedback to us via the following method: 3456789liu@gmail.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bass Booster &amp; Eq Plus is an easy-to-operate, simple, and free app. And that is specially designed for music enthusiasts. this application can adjust the volume, customize the sound effect presets, and you can also change the skin of the application according to your preferences!<br><br>So what are the functions of Bass Booster &amp; Eq Plus:<br>-Compatible with your favorite music players.<br>-Clean, simple interface and user-friendly, we have simple and beautiful design.<br>-Manually adjust the volume booster to increase your volume higher than the system default value. You can also manually adjust the bass booster and virtualizer at will.<br>-You can directly play/pause or click to play the next/previous song from Bass Booster &amp; Eq Plus.<br>-5-band equalizer. According to different music genres, 9 equalizer presets are available for free.<br>-Custom equalizer presets, the &quot;Save&quot; option can store your custom presets, and you can edit or delete custom presets at any time.<br>-You can change the skin of the application according to your preferences.<br>-Support headphone, video player, and vehicular audio.<br><br>A good volume booster can bring you a fantastic music experience! We insist on easy-to-use volume booster application. Choose this application to make your voice louder! <br><br>Need to be reminded here:<br>Playing audio at high volume may damage your hearing or damage the speakers. We recommend that you gradually increase the volume to obtain a suitable volume. <br><br>If you have any problems with the app, please send your questions/ feedback to us via the following method: 3456789liu@gmail.com.",
